@HostAddress = http://127.0.0.1:5081
@apiKey = devkey

### Get Notification (channel state)
GET {{HostAddress}}/notification
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Test Notification (WhatsApp)
POST {{HostAddress}}/notification/test
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "channel": "WhatsApp"
}
